 "remarks": "Welcome to 71 Aiken Street, Unit G1, a desirable end unit set within the soughtafter Winnipauk Village condominium community. This multilevel townhousestyle home offers two generously sized bedrooms, two full bathrooms, and a convenient half bath, creating a functional layout with ample space to live, work, and entertain. The main level features a versatile living and dining area anchored by a woodburning fireplace, along with a private balcony that provides a relaxing outdoor retreat. The unit also includes a garage, adding valuable convenience and additional storage. A finished lower level offers flexible space perfect for a home office, fitness area, media room, or guest accommodations. Residents of Winnipauk Village enjoy access to wellmaintained amenities including swimming pools, a fitness center, clubhouse, and recreational courts. Ideally located near shopping, dining, major commuter routes, and MetroNorth rail service, this home blends comfort, convenience, and community living.",
